      "draft": false,
      "prerelease": false,
      "body": "<div align=\"center\">\n\n[![Release Downloads](https://img.shields.io/github/downloads/821869798/carton/v0.6.2/total?style=flat-square&logo=github)](https://github.com/821869798/carton/releases/tag/v0.6.2)\n\n</div>\n\n**Download based on your OS:**\n\n如果不确定下载哪个版本，Windows 用户优先选择 <a href=\"https://github.com/821869798/carton/releases/download/v0.6.2/carton-0.6.2-win-x64-Setup.exe\"><code>win-x64</code> 安装版</a>，Linux 用户优先选择 <a href=\"https://github.com/821869798/carton/releases/download/v0.6.2/carton-0.6.2-linux-x64.AppImage\"><code>linux-x64</code> AppImage 版</a>。\n\n<table>\n  <thead align=\"left\">\n    <tr>\n      <th>OS</th>\n      <th>Download</th>\n    </tr>\n  </thead>\n  <tbody align=\"left\">\n    <tr>\n      <td>Windows</td>\n      <td>\n        <a href=\"https://github.com/821869798/carton/releases/download/v0.6.2/carton-0.6.2-win-x64-Setup.exe\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Setup-x64-2d7d9a.svg?logo=windows\" alt=\"Windows x64 Setup\"></a><br>\n        <a href=\"https://github.com/821869798/carton/releases/download/v0.6.2/carton-0.6.2-win-x64-portable.zip\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Portable-x64-67b7d1.svg?logo=windows\" alt=\"Windows x64 Portable\"></a><br>\n        <a href=\"https://github.com/821869798/carton/releases/download/v0.6.2/carton-0.6.2-win-arm64-Setup.exe\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Setup-ARM64-0063B1.svg?logo=windows\" alt=\"Windows ARM64 Setup\"></a><br>\n        <a href=\"https://github.com/821869798/carton/releases/download/v0.6.2/carton-0.6.2-win-arm64-portable.zip\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Portable-ARM64-4AA8FF.svg?logo=windows\" alt=\"Windows ARM64 Portable\"></a>\n      </td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Linux</td>\n      <td>\n        <a href=\"https://github.com/821869798/carton/releases/download/v0.6.2/carton-0.6.2-linux-x64.AppImage\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/AppImage-x64-f84e29.svg?logo=linux\" alt=\"Linux x64 AppImage\"></a><br>\n        <a href=\"https://github.com/821869798/carton/releases/download/v0.6.2/carton-0.6.2-linux-x64-portable.tar.gz\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Portable-x64-FCC624.svg?logo=linux\" alt=\"Linux x64 Portable\"></a><br>\n        <a href=\"https://github.com/821869798/carton/releases/download/v0.6.2/carton-0.6.2-linux-arm64.AppImage\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/AppImage-ARM64-DD4814.svg?logo=linux\" alt=\"Linux ARM64 AppImage\"></a><br>\n        <a href=\"https://github.com/821869798/carton/releases/download/v0.6.2/carton-0.6.2-linux-arm64-portable.tar.gz\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Portable-ARM64-FFB000.svg?logo=linux\" alt=\"Linux ARM64 Portable\"></a>\n      </td>\n    </tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n\n**Notes**\n\n- Channel: `release`\n- Built-in sing-box kernel version: `1.14.1`\n- You can update and replace the bundled kernel inside the app (`Settings -> Kernel`).\n- `.nupkg` and `releases*.json` are for auto-update and usually do not need to be downloaded manually.\n\n**Kernel Compatibility**\n\n- 中文：从 `0.6.0` 开始，carton 最低仅支持 `1.14+` 版本的内核；如需使用低版本内核，请使用之前的 carton 版本。\n- English: Starting with `0.6.0`, carton requires a sing-box kernel version `1.14` or newer. To use older kernel versions, please stay on a previous carton release.\n\n**Commit Logs**\n\n## 🐛 Fixes\n\n- fix(ui): Inter 缺中文时回退到系统 CJK 字体，并还原启动配置列表 16px\n\n## 📦 Other\n\n- ci: 增强 WinGet 提交与内核下载的稳定性\n- refactor(ui): 导航生命周期收敛到 PageViewModelBase，删除死属性与常驻 Groups 槽\n- feat(groups): 分组页延迟/测速显示修复，加空状态与标题、状态行调整\n- fix(linux): 托盘宿主重启后自动重新注册托盘图标\n- fix(groups): 分组测速状态机——引用计数泄漏、重建丢菊花、跨会话隔离\n- chore(i18n): 本地化收口——补回丢失键、删 12 条未引用键、加三条守卫\n- style(ui): 调整主页卡片内边距为 14px\n- chore: 发布 0.6.2 版本\n- ci(winget): 明确要求 workflow scope 并增强上游同步失败错误提示\n- fix(download): 内核下载不再因非法 User-Agent 立即失败\n- fix(download): 恢复系统代理、解耦连接超时，失败弹窗不再一律归咎\"没收到数据\"\n- chore(downloader): 内嵌 Downloader 源码重写为合法 UTF-8\n- style(dashboard): 状态三卡标题/内容间距 +6px，出站模式卡 +2px\n\n\n",
