      "body": "<div align=\"center\">\n\n[![Release Downloads](https://img.shields.io/github/downloads/821869798/carton/v0.6.1/total?style=flat-square&logo=github)](https://github.com/821869798/carton/releases/tag/v0.6.1)\n\n</div>\n\n**Download based on your OS:**\n\n如果不确定下载哪个版本，Windows 用户优先选择 <a href=\"https://github.com/821869798/carton/releases/download/v0.6.1/carton-0.6.1-win-x64-Setup.exe\"><code>win-x64</code> 安装版</a>，Linux 用户优先选择 <a href=\"https://github.com/821869798/carton/releases/download/v0.6.1/carton-0.6.1-linux-x64.AppImage\"><code>linux-x64</code> AppImage 版</a>。\n\n<table>\n  <thead align=\"left\">\n    <tr>\n      <th>OS</th>\n      <th>Download</th>\n    </tr>\n  </thead>\n  <tbody align=\"left\">\n    <tr>\n      <td>Windows</td>\n      <td>\n        <a href=\"https://github.com/821869798/carton/releases/download/v0.6.1/carton-0.6.1-win-x64-Setup.exe\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Setup-x64-2d7d9a.svg?logo=windows\" alt=\"Windows x64 Setup\"></a><br>\n        <a href=\"https://github.com/821869798/carton/releases/download/v0.6.1/carton-0.6.1-win-x64-portable.zip\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Portable-x64-67b7d1.svg?logo=windows\" alt=\"Windows x64 Portable\"></a><br>\n        <a href=\"https://github.com/821869798/carton/releases/download/v0.6.1/carton-0.6.1-win-arm64-Setup.exe\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Setup-ARM64-0063B1.svg?logo=windows\" alt=\"Windows ARM64 Setup\"></a><br>\n        <a href=\"https://github.com/821869798/carton/releases/download/v0.6.1/carton-0.6.1-win-arm64-portable.zip\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Portable-ARM64-4AA8FF.svg?logo=windows\" alt=\"Windows ARM64 Portable\"></a>\n      </td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Linux</td>\n      <td>\n        <a href=\"https://github.com/821869798/carton/releases/download/v0.6.1/carton-0.6.1-linux-x64.AppImage\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/AppImage-x64-f84e29.svg?logo=linux\" alt=\"Linux x64 AppImage\"></a><br>\n        <a href=\"https://github.com/821869798/carton/releases/download/v0.6.1/carton-0.6.1-linux-x64-portable.tar.gz\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Portable-x64-FCC624.svg?logo=linux\" alt=\"Linux x64 Portable\"></a><br>\n        <a href=\"https://github.com/821869798/carton/releases/download/v0.6.1/carton-0.6.1-linux-arm64.AppImage\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/AppImage-ARM64-DD4814.svg?logo=linux\" alt=\"Linux ARM64 AppImage\"></a><br>\n        <a href=\"https://github.com/821869798/carton/releases/download/v0.6.1/carton-0.6.1-linux-arm64-portable.tar.gz\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Portable-ARM64-FFB000.svg?logo=linux\" alt=\"Linux ARM64 Portable\"></a>\n      </td>\n    </tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n\n**Notes**\n\n- Channel: `release`\n- Built-in sing-box kernel version: `1.14.0`\n- You can update and replace the bundled kernel inside the app (`Settings -> Kernel`).\n- `.nupkg` and `releases*.json` are for auto-update and usually do not need to be downloaded manually.\n\n**Kernel Compatibility**\n\n- 中文：从 `0.6.0` 开始，carton 最低仅支持 `1.14+` 版本的内核；如需使用低版本内核，请使用之前的 carton 版本。\n- English: Starting with `0.6.0`, carton requires a sing-box kernel version `1.14` or newer. To use older kernel versions, please stay on a previous carton release.\n\n**Commit Logs**\n\n## 🐛 Fixes\n\n- fix(logging): eliminate duplicate log entries and reduce per-entry allocations\n- fix(build): restore utf-8 XML declaration in carton.GUI.csproj\n- fix(logging): threshold-based level filter and live kernel log level\n- fix(groups): honest group test completion and fresh delays after page return\n- fix(secrets): DPAPI 回到 ProtectedData 包，并收紧偏好文件的落盘权限\n\n## 📦 Other\n\n- fix: 对齐 URLTest 组测速与最终选中状态更新\n- chore: normalize repository line endings according to .gitattributes\n- fix: 修复 Linux TUN 内核授权只完成 chown 未设 setuid\n- perf: 深度优化内存占用、精简依赖库与Proto定义并内嵌Downloader源码\n- fix: 修复内存优化器空操作、若干泄漏与合规问题，并重组脚本目录\n- feat(dashboard): 配置区拆成两张卡片、配置列表独立成卡并换成 ListBox\n- refactor(nav): 去掉导航栏指示条位置计算里的硬编码常量\n- fix(connections): 连接监视器串行接力，且被取代的循环不得再写快照\n- fix(dashboard): 内核 Starting/Stopping 期间禁用配置列表，并把测试名收窄到它真正证明的范围\n- docs(memory): 说清 blocking GC 的真实代价，并去掉托盘隐藏时重复触发的那次 GC\n- feat(prefs): 系统代理/虚拟网卡开关改为全局，且不再改写用户 tun 节点的参数\n- style(ui): 默认窗口大小调整为 910x658，统一主页卡片内边距为 12px\n- chore: 发布 0.6.1 版本\n\n\n",
